--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Network
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MIMI works offline. One feature can use the network, and only one: looking up
lyrics for a song whose file carries none. It is off until the listener turns it
on in Settings, it is asked for one song at a time, and it is never done in the
background.

    lrclib.net    public lyrics database, no account and no key
                  https://lrclib.net

Nothing else in the app opens a connection, and no listening history, library
contents or identifiers are sent with a lookup: a request carries only the song
title, artist, album and length of the one song asked about.

